* lib.a99 - the library module of the obj2ea5 demo (see main.a99).
* SHOW: R0 = VRAM address, R1 = a length-prefixed string; writes it.
* R2 is changed.
       DEF  SHOW,MSG
       REF  VDPWA,VDPWD       the console's fixed names: obj2ea5 knows them
SHOW   ORI  R0,>4000          a write address
       SWPB R0
       MOVB R0,@VDPWA         low byte first
       SWPB R0
       MOVB R0,@VDPWA
       MOVB *R1+,R2
       SRL  R2,8
SH1    MOVB *R1+,@VDPWD
       DEC  R2
       JNE  SH1
       RT
MSG    BYTE 28
       TEXT 'LINKED FROM TWO OBJECT FILES'
       EVEN
       END
